      "statement": "Loki 3.0.0 enables structured metadata by default. It requires the active schema to use the tsdb index and the v13 schema, otherwise Loki won't start. Exposed: the Loki config has no tsdb store or no v13 schema, and structured metadata isn't disabled through limits_config allow_structured_metadata: false or -validation.allow-structured-metadata=false."
